- Leave Arlette with hope
	catherine: Thank you for giving me somewhere to stay.
	Arlette (Arlette_talking): You are welcome.
	catherine: If you ever hear another strange story about this town, remember that sometimes the creature in the story has a reason for what it does.
	Arlette (Arlette_smug): You sound almost fond of them.
	catherine: Perhaps I am, I came here hoping for something and I didn’t get it. But I think I got something different.
	Arlette (Arlette_smug): Cheer yourself up, Catherine. This isn't over until it is.
	catherine: What does that even mean?
	Arlette (Arlette_smug): I don’t know. Well, all I can say is I was enchanted to meet you.
	Arlette (Arlette_disappointed): Yes, I was enchanted to meet you.
	catherine: Same Arlette, friends?
	Arlette (Arlette_smug): Friends.
