- Warn Arlette about Marloch
	catherine: If anyone asks about me after I leave, tell them not to follow my path.
	Arlette: Why?
	catherine: Because some wishes are better left unanswered.
	Arlette (Arlette_angry): What happened?
	catherine: I found what I came looking for. I wish I hadn't.
	Arlette (Arlette_confused): And?
